{"ts":"2026-07-30T06:31:43.315Z","lvl":"debug","ctx":"app:module=llm","msg":"  think","data":{"agent":"main","preview":"The issue is in the AI智能体模块. The decompose seems to have mixed up the C-end AI flow and the promoter AI flow. Let me look at the specific issues:\n\n1. seq-151: 废旧手机估价流程 should ask about 机况 (A.不开机屏幕坏 B.开机屏幕坏 C.其他情况), but the description says \"不进一步询问机况，直接进入报价环节\" - this is wrong\n2. seq-153: 附近门店推送 incorrectly describes promoter's \"确认成交\" button instead of pushing nearby store card\n3. seq-150: \"帮用户估价入口（底部导航）\" is a promoter feature incorrectly placed under C-end 废旧手机流程\n\nThese are R4 level issues within the AI智能体模块. Let me fix them.\n\nIssues are within the AI智能体模块 (R1) → sub-modules related to 废旧手机估价流程 (R2) → specific functions (R3) → sub-functions (R4).\n\nLet me write precise instructions at the right levels.\n\nFor R4:\n1. seq-151: Change the description to match the requirement - AI should ask about 机况 (A.不开机屏幕坏 B.开机屏幕坏 C.其他情况)\n2. seq-153: Change description to \"推送附近门店小程序卡片，引导用户到店交易\" instead of promoter's confirm deal\n3. seq-150: Move \"帮用户估价入口（底部导航）\" from C端废旧流程 to 推广人员版小程序 AI智能体估价入口\n\nActually, the issue is about sub-functions being mixed up. Let me be precise."}}
