{"ts":"2026-07-30T06:33:57.069Z","lvl":"debug","ctx":"app:module=llm","msg":"  think","data":{"agent":"main","preview":"The issue is in the AI智能体 → 角色识别与引导 → 推广人员角色识别 (seq 175-177). The promoter role recognition flow in the AI智能体 module is incorrectly describing a C-end user flow (asking about 机况 and pushing nearby stores). \n\nFor the promoter role identification in AI智能体, the requirement (10.5) says: \"推广人员从小程序进入→按推广端流程引导\"\n\nAnd the promoter AI flow should be: direct valuation, no need to guide to stores since they are the ones collecting the phones.\n\nSince this is within the AI智能体 module (R1) → 角色识别与引导 (R2) → 推广人员角色识别 (R3/R4 level), I need to fix the sub-functions.\n\nAlso, the issue says these functions (seq 175-177) are duplicating the functions already in 推广人员版小程序 AI智能体估价入口 (seq 84-87). So I need to either:\n1. Remove the duplicate or incorrect sub-functions from the AI智能体 角色识别 section, or\n2. Correct them to match the promoter flow\n\nLet me fix the R4 descriptions for the promoter role identification in the AI智能体 module."}}
